{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n\nWhere the CFO directive of 1 July 2026 and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies. [[cite:obs-6d0dde337971c5d25cb5650c373f16060fd8b619 \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"34cb573315fc08aa9b96c20e0d30ca61e96a7722c20d4d2d14b7eb8aa29c61c0","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed mention of the procurement policy's 2000 EUR limit to comply with the directive precedence and acceptance checks; kept only the single-signature purchase limit of 1000 EUR as per CFO directive with exact citations."}